# Long-running jobs: verify progress, not liveness

A background job is not launched until its progress guard is launched in the same turn. Report a job healthy only by naming an artifact that moved since the last check, never by liveness or CPU, and never pause or signal another session's job. Invoke `long-job-safety` before launching, backgrounding, supervising, restarting or stopping a job expected to run for minutes or more; if it cannot load, do not launch unguarded.
